// tumour suppressor proteins; targeted drugs. REAL data: B.diseaseModel (Doll 2004, Peto 2000, Brown 2018) and
// B.mutationModel (Falcaro 2021, Cancer Research UK), each cited where it appears. HYPOTHETICAL data (two towns, dye
